 qualidade de vida.\n\nLocalização privilegiada, próxima ao centro e a uma ampla variedade de comércios e serviços, garantindo praticidade para o dia a dia.\n\nUm imóvel único para quem busca conforto, exclusividade e uma excelente localização.\n\nParcerias são bem vindas!","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1c33262e14a8982f9a8a8d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/306825fd-01cb-474e-a1a7-199d3e2a3e10.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1c33262e14a8982f9a8a8d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/4fa56154-bdb1-4bf4-a07d-20414498d757.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1c33262e14a8982f9a8a8d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b169c500-6d47-4e01-b9e7-663843cb0493.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1c33262e14a8982f9a8a8d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/91b5d30c-980c-4b87-bb9c-82000dc3c0e0.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1c33262e14a8982f9a8a8d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/4d87ff40-4c7b-4e51-9884-6875d3ff82fc.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1c33262e14a8982f9a8a8d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/cc23b3b9-26e3-4ff1-8816-bef0abd7f84a.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1c33262e14a8982f9a8a8d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/b0bd751d-9f35-4d9b-af4f-69e734f645e3.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1c33262e14a8982f9a8a8d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9d367858-887f-4edb-8bff-dce5f5b34932.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1c33262e14a8982f9a8a8d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/c412a4ea-0096-43a5-b353-440937293e9c.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1c33262e14a8982f9a8a8d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/8f28ad43-5042-4ea1-a3b0-1655c1b0dbe8.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1c33262e14a8982f9a8a8d/pilar-homes-images-watermark/6ac883f1-fa50-449d-bf78-4e484e4cf036.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6a1c33262e14a8982f9a8a8d/